---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Landscape from '../components/Landscape.astro';
import BrushButton from '../components/BrushButton.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Base title="The idea — Dawas Shlef" description="A thoughtful place to discover tools, skills, prompts, and workflows for working with AI.">
  <section class="about-page container"><span class="eyebrow">A note about this shelf</span><h1>A little less noise.<br /><em>A little more intention.</em></h1><div class="about-layout"><div class="prose"><p class="lede">There is always another tool, another prompt, another way to work. This is a place to slow down and find a useful starting point.</p><h2>A library you can use</h2><p>Explore a website before opening it. Give your agent a reusable skill. Copy a prompt and make it your own. Follow a workflow one thoughtful step at a time.</p><h2>Keep what helps</h2><p>Save resources to My shelf as you browse. Your saved items stay in this browser, on this device. There is no account to create.</p><h2>A small beginning</h2><p>This first collection brings together public tools, original starter prompts, and sample skills and workflows. It is a starting library, ready to grow with the resources and personal notes its curator adds.</p><p>Website illustrations are labeled as previews. They are visual introductions, rather than screenshots or live versions of the products. Original authors and projects are credited on each resource page.</p><BrushButton href="/resources/">Find something useful <Icon name="arrow" size={19} /></BrushButton></div><div class="about-art"><Landscape small /><p>Collect with care.<br />Create with curiosity.</p></div></div></section>
</Base>
